# The build's one product.
vim

# The frozen snapshot of this tree, plus the harness baselines.  Data, and a
# copy of what git already has -- not source.  See CLAUDE.md.
.reference/

# The exported session transcript, written by /export whenever CLAUDE.md is
# updated.  Half a megabyte of conversation; the reasoning that matters is in
# the commit messages.
TRANSCRIPT.md

# The pristine vim tree the makefile clones in for a pass and deletes after.
# 8,581 files that must never reach a commit.  See GOAL.md.
upstream/

# What a pass leaves behind: the agent's raw stream, and the insight log it
# keeps as it works.  PROGRESS.md is transient by design -- its insights are
# folded into GOAL.md, CLAUDE.md and tools/, and then it goes.
PROGRESS.md
pass.log

# Editing this tree with the editor it builds.
*.swp

# Python leaves these beside tools/.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Claude Code's per-project directory.
.claude/
